<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>GIRLS</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">The Kid LAROI</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">GIRLS</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">7z3PblAN3dH1JMewiRydkZ</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.830" end="00:07.460">Fall in love for no reason, uh (fallin')</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.460" end="00:10.170">She turned to me and then she said, ay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.170" end="00:12.390">Girls just wanna dance, uh, ay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.390" end="00:15.020">Girls just wanna have fun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.020" end="00:17.390">I don't know your plans, ay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.390" end="00:19.780">I just wanna, uh, get some</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.780" end="00:21.280">Girls want a summer with their friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.160" end="00:24.330">Wanna do it to their ex and then get the job, uh, done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.330" end="00:26.830">Girls just wanna dance, uh, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.830" end="00:28.330">Girls just wanna have-</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.140" end="00:30.470">Fuck your ex-man, I'm the man now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.470" end="00:32.950">Think I feel bad, he was fanned out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.950" end="00:35.390">Do what you like, you've been too nice</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.390" end="00:37.580">He didn't do right, that's too bad now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.580" end="00:40.640">I see that you worked all night, you're tryna cash out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.640" end="00:43.160">You and your friends are tryna lash out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.160" end="00:45.100">And I'm not the one to tell 'em, "Stand down"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.100" end="00:48.170">It's their world and they just wanna (ay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.170" end="00:50.480">Girls just wanna dance, uh, ay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.480" end="00:52.910">Girls just wanna have fun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.910" end="00:55.370">I don't know your plans, ay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.370" end="00:57.500">I just wanna, uh, get some</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.500" end="00:59.150">Girls want a summer with their friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.150" end="01:02.440">Wanna do it to their ex and then get the job, uh, done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.440" end="01:04.750">Girls just wanna dance, uh, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.750" end="01:06.470">Girls just wanna have-</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.470" end="01:09.070">Now if somebody try to get dumb for real (ay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.070" end="01:11.050">Watch somebody get done for real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.050" end="01:13.480">'Cause, baby, you a ten and the one for real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.480" end="01:16.380">You ran into some lames, but I'm for real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.380" end="01:18.680">You worked all night, you're tryna cash out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.680" end="01:21.030">You and your friends are tryna lash out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.030" end="01:23.230">And I'm not the one to tell 'em, "Stand down"</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.230" end="01:26.280">It's their world and they just wanna (ay)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.280" end="01:28.460">Girls just wanna dance, uh, ay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.460" end="01:31.020">Girls just wanna have fun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.020" end="01:33.370">I don't know your plans, ay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.370" end="01:35.720">I just wanna, uh, get some</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.720" end="01:37.260">Girls want a summer with their friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.260" end="01:40.300">Wanna do it to their ex and then get the job, uh, done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.300" end="01:42.770">Girls just wanna dance, uh, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.770" end="01:45.130">Girls just wanna have fun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.130" end="01:50.060">You can do what you want when you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.060" end="01:55.760">I can give you the night that you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.760" end="01:58.810">Want, want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.810" end="02:01.190">Side by side, I'ma hit it in the mornin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.190" end="02:04.230">Side to side, you gon' get it how you want it, 'cause</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.230" end="02:06.520">Girls just wanna dance, ay (oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.520" end="02:09.070">Girls just wanna have fun (ooh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.070" end="02:11.320">I don't know your plans, ay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.320" end="02:13.530">I just wanna, uh, get some</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.530" end="02:15.240">Girls want a summer with their friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.240" end="02:18.330">Wanna do it to their ex and then get the job, uh, done</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.330" end="02:20.700">Girls just wanna dance, uh, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.700" end="02:24.590">Girls just wanna have fun</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.590" end="02:29.290">And I'm fallin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.290" end="02:33.290" /></div></body></tt>